verses:
Hallelujah, Amen!  Gifts we bring to Thee alone;
Lord, we adore Thee, kneeling now, here before Thy throne;
Oh, wondrous Saviour, who will reign forever!

items.lyrics:
Hallelujah, Amen!  Gifts we bring to Thee alone;
Lord, we adore Thee, kneeling now, here before Thy throne;
Oh, wondrous Saviour, who will reign forever!

Hallelujah, Amen!  To the Holy Lord we sing!
All comes from Thee, O loving Father, let praises ring!
Oh, wondrous Saviour, who will reign forever!

verses:
Take my life and let it be, Consecrated, Lord, to Thee;
Take my hands and let them move, At the impulse of Thy love.
All to Thee, all to Thee, Consecrated, Lord, to Thee.

Take my feet and let them be Swift and beautiful for Thee;
Take my voice and let me sing, Always only for my King.
All to Thee, all to Thee, Consecrated, Lord, to Thee.

Take my lips and let them be, Fill’d with messages from Thee;
Take my silver and my gold, Not a mite would I with hold.
All to Thee, all to Thee, Consecrated, Lord, to Thee.

Take my love, my God, I pour,  At Thy feet its treasure stores;
Take myself and I will be, Ever, only, all for Thee.
All to Thee, all to Thee, Consecrated, Lord, to Thee.

