verses:
The Lord has brought us together, For us to learn His true way;
With the Spirit’s love and guidance, All of His Word we’ll obey;
The love of God’s worth rememb’ring, Ever His praises we’ll sing,
Though we must part for the moment, No sorrow our spirits mar;
We’ll strive to keep His commandments, And spread His glory afar.

His truth is found in His Spirit, Forever it will abide;
One faith to keep, with god leading, We will for Him ever strive;
Spreading the gospel and seeking To bring the lost unto Him.
Praying for others in Spirit, Tho’ parted we’re of one heart;
Bear spiritual gifts for His glory, In heaven we’ll never part.

