Take time to be hoIy, Let Him be thy guide,
And run not before Him Whatever be tide;
In joy or in sorrow Still follow thy Lord,
And looking to Jesus, Still trust in His Word.

Take time to be holy, Be calm in thy soul;
Each tho‘t and each motive Beneath His control,
Thus led by His Spirit To fountains of love,
Thou soon shalt be fitted For service above.

verses:
Teach me to pray, Lord, teach me to pray;
This is my heart cry day unto day;
I long to know Thy will and Thy way;
Teach me to pray, Lord, teach me to pray.

Living in Thee, Lord, and Thou in me,
Constant abiding, this is my plea;
Grant me Thy power, boundless and free,
Power with men and power with Thee.

Teach me to pray, Lord, teach me to pray;
Thou art my pattern day unto day;
Thou art my surety, now and for aye,
Teach me to pray, Lord, teach me to pray.

Living in Thee, Lord, and Thou in me,
Constant abiding, this is my plea;
Grant me Thy power, boundless and free,
Power with men and power with Thee.

