verses:
All my sins are gone,
All because of Calvary;
Life is filled with song,
All because of Calvary;
Christ my Saviour lives,
Lives from sin to set me free;
Some day He’s coming,
O wondrous, blessed day,
All, yes, all because of Calvary.

