verses:
Come, oh, come, when Christ is calling, Linger not in paths of sin;
Sever ev‘ry tie that binds you, And the heav’nly race begin.
Calling now, calling now, Hear the Saviour calling now;
Calling now, calling now, Hear the Saviour calling now.

Come, oh, come, delay no longer, For th‘accepted time is now;
Yield, oh yield yourself to Jesus, And before His sceptre bow.
Calling now, calling now, Hear the Saviour calling now;
Calling now, calling now, Hear the Saviour calling now.

